<figure id="S5.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.21682v1/urban_v2.png" id="S5.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:685/310;" width="685" height="310" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 8</span>: </span><span id="S5.F8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Infinite outdoor 3D scene generation by WorldGrow. Our method synthesizes diverse scenes such as urban streetscapes with plausible layouts, coherent suburban neighborhoods with consistent styles, showing WorldGrow’s ability to be adapted to various domains.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
